176: /// Flatten a ring onto the plane it was cut on, whatever that plane is.
177: ///
178: /// Only the perimeter is ever wanted from a limb section, and a perimeter does
179: /// not care which way the axes point, so any orthonormal pair perpendicular to
180: /// the normal will do.

