116: /// `Set Hair Curve Profile`, as far as the strands carry it: each strand's
117: /// root radius, with some variation. How the radius falls off to the tip is
118: /// the material's ([`crate::HairMaterial::taper`]), applied where strands
119: /// are drawn.
120: #[derive(Clone, Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]
121: pub struct Profile {
122:     /// Root radius, metres. Human hair is 17 to 90 microns across.
123:     pub radius: f32,
124:     /// Each strand's radius is scaled by up to this much either way.
125:     pub random: f32,
126:     pub seed: i32,
127:     /// Scale each strand's radius by `radius` over the one it was grown
128:     /// with instead of setting it, keeping what interpolation made finer
129:     /// (the hairline's fine hair).
